  "releaseNotes": "v0.7.0: Embedded TR catalog grows to 33 entries (was 26). Adds t3320 (FNG_요약) + t3341 (재무순위종합) + t3202 (종목별 증시일정) under /stock/investinfo, t1601 (투자자별 종합) + t1702 (외인기관 종목별 동향) under /stock/investor, and t1404 (관리/불성실공시/투자유의) + t1405 (투자경고/매매정지/정리매매 …) under /stock/market-data. Backs the Mcp package's v0.7 screener wrappers (ls_get_fundamentals_rank / ls_get_investor_flow / ls_get_stock_events / ls_get_market_warnings) plus the A1 FICS industry enrichment path. No public API changes; lockstep version bump with RedoxNet.Mcp.LsOpenApi 0.7.0. See https://github.com/redoxnet/mcp-lsopenapi/blob/main/RELEASENOTES.Core.md for full notes.",
